# Feature pipeline (Attesta)

Follow the personal skill **dor-ship-pipeline**. Product commands: `docs/verify-matrix.md`.

## Parent clone (this workspace)

Coordination only. Do **not** implement features or fixes here. Do **not** leave uncommitted feature WIP on `main`.

Parent job: scope → launch a worker in a new worktree → return the PR URL.

Skip only if the user says `skip pipeline` or `implement inline`.

## Worker

1. `bash scripts/new-feature-worktree.sh feat/<short-name>` (or `best-of-n-runner`)
2. Implement the full slice in that worktree
3. Add tests; run `docs/verify-matrix.md` locally until green
4. Commit, push, `gh pr create` targeting `main`
5. Merge when MERGEABLE; run post-deploy checks; remove the worktree

One task → one worktree → one PR. Never commit to `main` in the parent clone.

## Attesta invariants still apply

`attesta-core.mdc` (append-only snapshots, PII strip, metering choke point, evidence-only adjudicator). Do not enable paid rails in a feature PR unless asked.
